# @url = https://hansard-api.govtechmy.xyz
@url = http://localhost:3000

###

GET {{url}}/api/health

###
GET {{url}}/api/catalogue/

### Search Dewan Rakyat for "sekolah" by author with uid 4266
GET {{url}}/api/search?q=sekolah&uid=4266&house=dewan-rakyat&window_size=100&page=1&page_size=10

### Search all houses for "sekolah"
GET {{url}}/api/search?q="minyak subsidi"&house=dewan-rakyat&house=dewan-negara&house=kamar-khas&window_size=100&page=1&page_size=10

### Search all houses for uid 4266
GET {{url}}/api/search?uid=4266&house=dewan-rakyat&house=dewan-negara&house=kamar-khas&window_size=100&page=1&page_size=10


### Search all houses for uid 4266
GET {{url}}/api/search?uid=4266&house=dewan-rakyat&house=dewan-negara&house=kamar-khas&window_size=100&page=1&page_size=10

### Search all houses for uid 4266
GET {{url}}/api/search-mp-doc?uid=4266&house=dewan-rakyat&house=dewan-negara&house=kamar-khas&window_size=100&page=21&page_size=10

### Search all houses for uid 4266
GET {{url}}/api/search-mp-doc/?uid=375&house=dewan-rakyat&window_size=150&page=1&page_size=10

### Search plot all houses for "sekolah"
GET {{url}}/api/search-plot?q=sekolah&house=dewan-rakyat&house=dewan-negara&house=kamar-khas&window_size=100&page=1&page_size=10

### Search plot Dewan Rakyat for "sekolah" by author with uid 4266 between 2007-01-01 and 2024-06-30
GET {{url}}/api/search-plot?house=dewan-rakyat&page=1&page_size=10&uid=4266&start_date=2007-01-01&end_date=2024-06-30

### Autocomplete search for "sekolah"
GET {{url}}/api/autocomplete?q=sekolah

### Sitting list for all houses
GET {{url}}/api/sitting/list?house=dewan-rakyat&house=dewan-negara&house=kamar-khas

### Sitting list for kamar khas
GET {{url}}/api/sitting/list?house=kamar-khas

### MMS catalogue: Penggal contains sitting_list directly; dates remain null
GET {{url}}/api/catalogue?house=majlis-mengangkat-sumpah&term=15

### MMS dropdown: no Mesyuarat folder
GET {{url}}/api/catalogue?house=majlis-mengangkat-sumpah&term=15&dropdown=true

### MMS sitting: cycle house=3, meeting/start_date/end_date=null
GET {{url}}/api/sitting?house=majlis-mengangkat-sumpah&date=2026-09-29

### DN on the same date must never return the MMS document (404 is valid)
GET {{url}}/api/sitting?house=dewan-negara&date=2026-09-29

### MMS sitting list accepts null cycle dates
GET {{url}}/api/sitting/list?house=majlis-mengangkat-sumpah

### All four houses, including MMS
GET {{url}}/api/sitting/list?house=semua

### Array semua also includes all four houses
GET {{url}}/api/sitting/list?house=dewan-negara&house=semua

### MMS search: house=3 and meeting=null
GET {{url}}/api/search?house=majlis-mengangkat-sumpah&start_date=2010-01-01

### Semua search includes MMS
GET {{url}}/api/search?house=semua&start_date=2010-01-01

### Array semua search includes MMS
GET {{url}}/api/search?house=dewan-negara&house=semua&start_date=2010-01-01

### MMS document search preserves meeting=null
GET {{url}}/api/search-mp-doc?house=majlis-mengangkat-sumpah&start_date=2010-01-01

### MMS plot
GET {{url}}/api/search-plot?house=majlis-mengangkat-sumpah&start_date=2010-01-01

### Counts include majlis_mengangkat_sumpah
GET {{url}}/api/search/counter?start_date=2010-01-01

### MMS PDF download
POST {{url}}/api/file/download
Content-Type: application/json

{"key":"majlismengangkatsumpah/mms_2026-09-29.pdf"}

### MMS CSV download
POST {{url}}/api/file/download
Content-Type: application/json

{"key":"majlismengangkatsumpah/mms_2026-09-29.csv"}


### Invalid MMS cycle: meeting must be null (expected 400; no row created)
POST {{url}}/api/parliamentary-cycle
Content-Type: application/json

{"house":3,"term":15,"session":5,"meeting":1,"start_date":null,"end_date":null}

### Invalid MMS cycle: dates must be null (expected 400; no row created)
POST {{url}}/api/parliamentary-cycle
Content-Type: application/json

{"house":3,"term":15,"session":5,"meeting":null,"start_date":"2026-09-01","end_date":"2026-09-30"}
